Hi Oleg,

Thanks for taking a look. I have attached the complete reports without
removing any content.

report7.txt corresponds to the warning quoted in my previous reply
(syz.2.658/3606).

report0.txt is another related report (syz.4.14275/37841). In this
report, the reporting task holds dev->event_lock at input_inject_event().
Its current stack includes evdev_ioctl(), input_inject_event(),
evdev_events(), evdev_pass_values(), __pass_event(), and kill_fasync().

This may help identify the input path calling kill_fasync() under
event_lock.

Thanks,
